  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenskt deltagande i MR-seminarium inom programmet &apos;Human Rights and Democratic Institutions in Moldova and Ukraine&apos;. Svenska experter och representanter fr&#xE5;n SHK (Svenska Helsingfors Kommitt&#xE9;n) medverkar i ett antal seminarier med inriktning p&#xE5; m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter under mars-juni 1999. Totalt st&#xF6;d: 150 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish participation in seminar on Human Rights within the program &apos;Human Rights and Democratic Institutions in Moldova and Ukraine&apos;. Swedish experts and representatives from SHK (Swedish Helsinki Committee) will participate in several seminars during the period march-june 1999. Total support: 150 000 SEK.</narrative>
